        "text": "Based on your simulated profile, your wellness score is **{score}/900** — the **{stage}** stage ({nick}). That's {delta} points {dir} last month.\n\nYour strongest area is **{best}**, and the area with most room to grow is **{worst}**. Financial health isn't a grade — it's a direction, and yours is {trend}.",
