      },
      "save": {
        "text": "You currently save about **{rate}%** of income (≈ {surplusF}/month in this simulation). A few low-effort ideas to explore:\n\n• Shifting just 5% of income ({fiveF}) to savings on salary day, before spending.\n• Reviewing your top expense category — small trims there often matter most.\n• Giving each goal its own labelled pot so progress is visible.\n\nThese are habits, not guarantees — pick the one that feels easiest.",
        "cards": [
          {
            "t": "Try a savings micro-challenge",
            "d": "2 minutes · +8 points",
            "href": "daily-activities.html",
            "icon": "coins"
          },
          {
