            "href": "daily-activities.html",
            "icon": "shield"
          }
        ]
      },
      "emergency": {
        "text": "A commonly taught guideline is **3 to 6 months** of essential expenses, depending on income stability and dependants.\n\nFor this simulated profile (monthly spend ≈ {expensesF}), that's roughly **{em3F} to {em6F}**. Your cushion today covers about **{emMonths} months**, so you're {emStatus}.\n\nIf an exact figure matters, adjust for your own situation — the guideline is a starting point.",
        "cards": [
          {
            "t": "Emergency fund check",
            "d": "3-minute daily activity",
